      "writtenOn": "2026-08-14T03:28:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is this docs\u0027 term for one of the `compositeSensorCount` sensors a `State Sensor PDR` describes.\n\nI have made that explicit in the intro paragraph of the section.",
      "parentUuid": "54bab9c1_29bac097",
